  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjP3gCbYV-vR-2QqnNdVsXtmF0m6YfHwMKspTr_bcd2WWaFHjtONzK0g8GFv4GMLo-0zd4mfluAfJq0DKeEN-kcMVQDDYgU4uxaBzb22V32e62j_sxgi-avsOcq-KeSYIOsBvFsfg0MOYaut6H5tC_YuRP7-U4TBw578FfwuggKNSUE4BT2NdwUdgIZpHg/s1024/Designer%20-%202024-12-29T130531.247.jpeg\"><img alt=\"חולה מחוייך מוקף ברופאים צוהלים\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjP3gCbYV-vR-2QqnNdVsXtmF0m6YfHwMKspTr_bcd2WWaFHjtONzK0g8GFv4GMLo-0zd4mfluAfJq0DKeEN-kcMVQDDYgU4uxaBzb22V32e62j_sxgi-avsOcq-KeSYIOsBvFsfg0MOYaut6H5tC_YuRP7-U4TBw578FfwuggKNSUE4BT2NdwUdgIZpHg/w320-h320/Designer%20-%202024-12-29T130531.247.jpeg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מתלוצץ עם רופאיו</span></h2><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וַיְצַו יוֹסֵף אֶת עֲבָדָיו אֶת הָרֹפְאִים לַחֲנֹט אֶת אָבִיו</span></blockquote><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">פַּעַם, הַכֹּל הָיָה,<br /></span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">הַרְבֵּה יוֹתֵר פָּשׁוּט.<br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כִּי כָּל רוֹפֵא רִפַּא,<br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">כָּל סוּג שֶׁל מִחוֹשׁ.</span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הָיוּ הֵם רַב-תְּחוּמִיִּים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">רַק לְעִתִּים, כָּרְתוּ גַּפַּיִם.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הִתְמַקְּדוּ בְּכִיבִים כּוֹאֲבִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְהֶחֱרִישׁוּ זַעֲקוֹת בִּמְצִלְתַּיִם.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וּבִכְלָל, כָּל רוֹפֵא,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">תִּפְקֵד גַּם כְּסַפָּר.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְחָנַט גּוּפוֹת יָפֶה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">לֹא לְצָרְכֵי מִסְחָר.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">חֶלְקָם הָיוּ גַּם בַּלָּנִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">אֲחֵרִים, טִפְּלוּ בְּשִׁגָּעוֹן.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מְיַלְּדִים אוֹ חוֹפְרֵי קְבָרִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">גְּמִישׁוּת לְלֹא קִבָּעוֹן.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">אֲבָל הַיּוֹם - אוֹיָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הַכֹּל פֹּה הִתְקַלְקֵל.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כִּי עוֹלַם הַבִּיּוֹלוֹגְיָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הִתְחִיל לְהִתְפַּצֵּל.</span></span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רוֹפֵא מִשְׁפָּחָה - לֹא מְקַבֵּל יְלָדִים,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְיֵשׁ רוֹפֵא מְיֻחָד לְקָנַאבִּיס.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל רוֹפֵא זָקוּק לְמַרְדִּים,</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲפִלּוּ לְטִפּוּל פְּסוֹרְיָאזִיס.</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְגַם, הִתְקַבְּצוּ הַחוֹנְטִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">נִרְשְׁמוּ לַפָקוּלְטָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'פָּתָלוֹגִים' הֵם קְרוּיִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הִתְאַגְּדוּ לְחוּנְטָה.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְעוֹקְרֵי נִּיבִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הָפְכוּ רוֹפְאֵי שִׁנַּיִם.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וּמֵאָז הֵם גּוֹבִים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">לְפָחוֹת פִּי שְׁנַיִם.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">שׁוֹטִים הָפְכוּ עוֹרָם,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">חֶלְקָם הַיּוֹם פְּסִיכִיאַטְרִים.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מְעַסִּים, זָקְפוּ גֵּוָם,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כִּי הַיּוֹם הֵם כִּירוֹפְּרָקְטִים.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וְכָל מִי שֶׁגָּמָא,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">תֵּה צְמָחִים סִינִי.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">נַעֲשָׂה בַּר-סַמְכָא,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">בְּטִפּוּל הוֹלִיסְטִי.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">לֹא צָרִיךְ לִכְתֹּב בְּרֶצֶף,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מִרְשָׁם - בִּכְתַב חַרְטֻמִּים,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">פָּשׁוּט, חַרְטֵט בְּשֶׁטֶף,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מֻנָּחִים לֹא בְּרוּרִים.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">\"הַחוֹלֶה זָקוּק לְאַסְפִּירַצְיָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">בִּגְלַל אָאוּרָה מִיגְרֶנוֹטִית.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">זוֹ כְּבָר סְפֵּקוּלַצְיָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">לְהַפְרָעָה נוֹיְרוֹטִית.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הוּא חָוָה אִיסְכֶּמְיָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">וּקְצָת אַנְגִּינָה פַּקְטוֹרִיס.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">אַחֲרֵי הַפְּרוֹצֵדוּרָה,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הוּא יָחוּשׁ קָתַרְזִיס\".</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הַתַּשְׁלוּם בִּמְזֻמָּן,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">הַמְּחִיר הוֹלִיסְטִי.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כִּי הָרוֹפֵא כָּאן,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">קְצָת קַפִּיטָלִיסְטִי.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div>טוֹב שֶׁיֵּשׁ לָהֶם אֶקְשֶׁן,</div><div>כְּשֶׁהֵם מַפְעִילִים סֶקְשֶׁן.</div><div>וִיכֹלֶת לְקַבֵּל פְּרוֹטֶקְשֶׁן,</div><div>ע\"י אִיּוּם בְּרִילוֹקֶיְשֶׁן.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">אֲבָל הֲכִי הֲכִי מְסֻכָּן,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">לְהַגִּיעַ בַּלַּיְלָה לְמִיּוּן.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">כִּי אֲפִלּוּ תּוֹרָן מְיֻמָּן,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">מְנֻמְנָם - יִטְעֶה בְּמִנּוּן.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">(תָּמִיד כֵּיף לְהִתְלוֹצֵץ,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">עִם רוֹפְאִים מֻמְחִים.</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">בִּמְקוֹם לְהִתְרוֹצֵץ,</span><br style=\"background-color: white;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\">בֵּין בָּתֵּי חוֹלִים...)</span></span></div>"
}
